    <l n="7" type="heading" level="1" para="true">LIBR. 3. INSTIT. TIT. 14.</l>
    <l n="8" type="heading" level="2" para="true">De Obligationibus.</l>
    <l n="9" type="heading" level="3" para="true">In Princ.</l>
    <l n="10">1. JUs duplex est, vel in re, vel adrem.</l>
    <l n="11">2. Obligatio in genere quotuplex?</l>
    <l n="12">3. Quid sit obligatio civilis?</l>
    <l n="13">4. Promissio quavis de jure Divino ser-</l>
    <l n="14">vanda si honestas.</l>
    <l n="15">5. Quid moribus &amp; jure Canonum obtineat?</l>
    <l n="16">§. 1.</l>
    <l n="17">Proponitur civilis obligationis divisio.</l>
    <l n="18">§. 2.</l>
    <l n="19">1. Alia obligationis traditur divisio.</l>
    <l n="20">2. Natura contractus explicatur.</l>
    <l n="21">3. Sunt contractus vel nominati, vel inno-</l>
    <l n="22">minati.</l>
    <l n="23">4. Quid moribus?</l>
    <l n="24">5. Quid jure Canonum?</l>
    <l n="25">6. Utrum quatuor sint species contractuum</l>
    <l n="26">nominatorum?</l>
    <l n="27" type="heading" level="1" para="true">LIBR. 3. INSTIT. TIT. 15.</l>
    <l n="28" type="heading" level="2" para="true">Quibus modis re contrahitur obligatio.</l>
    <l n="29" type="heading" level="3" para="true">In Princ.</l>
    <l n="30">1. QUo sensu re contrahi obligatio d-</l>
    <l n="31">icatur?</l>
    <l n="32">2. Mutuo datur quantitas.</l>
    <l n="33">3. Quo sensu mutuum sit alienatio?</l>
    <l n="34">5. Idem in genere reperiri potest.</l>
    <l n="35">6. In nummis consideratur valor.</l>
    <l n="36">7. Si mutetur valor, is spectatur qui</l>
    <l n="37">erat tempore contractus.</l>
    <l n="38">8. Quæ actio ex mutuo nascatur?</l>
    <l n="39">9. Quid circa mutuum secundum jus</l>
    <l n="40">Divinum obtineat?</l>
    <l n="41" type="heading" level="3" para="true">§. 1.</l>
    <l n="42">1. Indebitum est quasi mutuum.</l>
    <l n="43">2. Quot modis aliquid indebitum?</l>
    <l n="44">3. Quæ ignorantia faciat indebitum posse repeti?</l>
    <l n="45">4. Re obligatur qui indebitum accipit.</l>
    <l n="46">5. Cur detur condictio repetenti?</l>
    <l n="47">6. Quando cessef condictio?</l>
    <l n="48" type="heading" level="3" para="true">§. 2.</l>
    <l n="49">1. Definitur commodatum.</l>
    <l n="50">2. Mores recensentur.</l>
    <l n="51">3. Differentia multiplex inter mutuum</l>
    <l n="52">&amp; commodatum.</l>
    <l n="53">4. Quam culpam præstet commodatarius?</l>
    <l n="54">5. Quid jure Divino circa commodatum</l>
    <l n="55">obtineat?</l>
    <l n="56">6. Quid moribus?</l>
    <l n="57" type="heading" level="3" para="true">§. 3.</l>
    <l n="58">1. Natura depositi explicatur.</l>
    <l n="59">2. Sequestratio à vulgari depositio distincta.</l>
    <l n="60">3. Quid veniat in depositi actionem?</l>
    <l n="61">4. Jus Mosaicum explicatur.</l>
    <l n="62">5. Quid moribus?</l>
