    <l n="64">1. Differentia inter pignus &amp; hypothecam</l>
    <l n="65">multiplex.</l>
    <l n="66">2. Definitur pignus speciatim acceptum.</l>
    <l n="67">3. Quid veniat in actionem pignoraticiam?</l>
    <l n="68">4. Quid antichresis?</l>
